    "url": "https://jobs.lever.co/amanotes/9c01d3c1-febb-4a43-afba-6633dc6633e7",
    "desc": "ABOUT THE JOB\n\nWe are seeking a dynamic and innovative Product Owner to join our team, focusing on the development and delivery of outstanding mobile app experiences. In this role, you will collaborate with cross-functional teams to create seamless, high-quality apps that will engage and delight users worldwide. You will drive the product roadmap, monitor user engagement, and continuously improve the app’s functionality and performance.\n\nWHAT YOU WILL DO\n• Data Monitoring & Analysis: Monitor, collect, and analyze app user data, conduct market research to synthesize insights, and transform these insights into actionable recommendations for product improvements and new features.\n• User Stories & Prototypes: Translate user stories into detailed requirements and collaborate with design teams to create prototypes, wireframes, and user interaction diagrams for app enhancements.\n• Product Roadmap Management: Maintain and prioritize the product roadmap, ensuring initiatives are aligned with business objectives and have the maximum impact on user engagement and satisfaction.\n• Cross-functional Collaboration: Collaborate closely with development teams and other departments (UX/UI Design, Creative, Marketing, Quality\n• Control, User Acquisition) to deliver app features and improvements efficiently, effectively, and with optimal resource allocation.\n\nQUALIFICATIONS\n• Working experiences:\n• Minimum of 2-3 years of experience as a Product Owner in mobile app development, with experience delivering successful apps to the market.\n• Proven expertise in app design, user engagement, and monetization strategies for diverse revenue models (ads, in-app purchases, subscriptions, etc.).\n• Strong understanding of mobile app technologies, app performance metrics, and data-driven decision-making.\n• Ability to independently conduct research and stay updated on mobile app industry trends.\n• Skills:\n• A self-driven individual who takes full ownership and consistently delivers results\n• A continuous learner, eager to stay ahead of mobile market trends and apply new insights to drive product success.\n• A highly adaptable multi-tasker who proactively seeks opportunities to support the team and manage multiple game portfolios.\n• Demonstrates a strong interest in and understanding of technology, marketing, analytics, and data-driven solutions.\n• Experience creating wireframes, mockups, prototypes, and user interaction diagrams.\n• Practical application of Agile methodologies.\n• Fluent in English, both written and spoken.\n• An effective communicator capable of sharing ideas, discussing projects, and providing constructive feedback.\n\nWHAT WE OFFER\n• Competitive salary, 100% salary during probation\n• Performance bonus with 30% of company profit shared with no cap\n• Full SHUI as Vietnamese Law + Premium Private Medical Insurance and annual health check\n• Minimum 12 days paid annual leave + 10 days paid sick leave.\n• 12 days working from home per year\n• Annual flexi-budget (9.400.000 VNĐ/year) for personal development\n• Free daily lunch with 10+ menu options.\n• Free daily F&B: Snacks, juice, beverage, tea-time\n• Monthly/Bi-monthly team activity allowance\n• Company learning trip will be top of countries that we gain most profit. 1st is Korea, next destination is Japan\n• Sponsored sports activities: badminton, soccer, ...\n• Sponsored overseas conferences and industry events for all levels.\n• Modern equipments/AI tool provided.\nHow To Apply?\n\nClick the button or contact us at talents@uplive.zone",
