    "desc": "ABOUT VOODOO\n\nFounded in 2013, Voodoo is a tech company that creates mobile games and apps with a mission to entertain the world. Gathering 800 employees, 7 billion downloads, and over 200 million active users, Voodoo is the #3 mobile publisher worldwide in terms of downloads after Google and Meta. Our portfolio includes chart-topping games like Mob Control and Block Jam, alongside popular apps such as BeReal and Wizz.\n\n\n\n\nTEAM\n\nThe Engineering & Data team builds innovative tech products and platforms to support the impressive growth of Voodoo's gaming and consumer apps, keeping us at the forefront of the mobile industry. The team plays a key role in Voodoo's long-term strategy: it accelerates product diversification and provides a state-of-the-art growth engine to distribute and scale our games. We create solutions that drive growth with a pragmatic approach, ranging from simple search to complex machine learning systems.\n\nWithin Engineering & Data, the Central Data & Analytics team makes data a reliable guide for the whole company. Data engineers, analytics engineers, data analysts and a product data PM work side by side to build and grow the foundations behind every critical business and product decision at Voodoo.\n\nThis position is hybrid and requires 3 days/week in our Paris office.\n\n\n\n\nROLE\n\nWe’re looking for a Senior Data Engineer to join our Engineering & Data team. In this role, you’ll be responsible for a wide array of topics such as:\n\n - Build and operate robust data pipelines that keep pace with ever-evolving business needs, ensuring the architecture supports them cleanly.\n\n - Contribute to the codebase, ship and maintain your changes in production, and champion strong coding and data engineering practices.\n\n - Use AI coding tools (Claude Code, Codex, and whatever comes next) as a core part of your daily workflow — to move faster on pipelines, migrations, tests and documentation — while staying fully accountable for what you merge.\n\n - Look for opportunities to put AI inside our data platform, not just around it: LLM-assisted data quality checks, semantic layers, natural-language access to datasets, agent-driven internal tooling.\n\n - Take ownership of projects from initial discussions to release: feature estimation and scoping, architecture design, benchmarking of new technologies, product feedback.\n\n - Work in a very agile environment with a fast decision process.\n\n - Collaborate directly with back-end engineers, data scientists, mobile game and consumer app teams, product and marketing.\n\n\n\n\nPROFILE\n\nProvide a bullet point list of the hard and soft skills required for the role, with up to 10 key requirements for the role.\n\n\n\n\nOUR STACK\n\n - Amazon Web Services; Python; Spark; Scala; Terraform; SQL (Athena, StarRocks); DBT;; Airflow; Kubernetes; AI-assisted development tooling (Claude Code, MCP-based internal tools)\n\n\n\n\nBENEFITS\n\n - Competitive salary based on experience\n\n - Swile Lunch voucher\n\n - Gymlib (100% covered by Voodoo)\n\n - Premium healthcare coverage with SideCare, 100% covered for you and your family\n\n - Wellness activities in our Paris office\n\n - Remote Fridays",
