    "desc": "HYBRID WORK MODEL: 3 DAYS PER WEEK (60%) IN OUR WROCLAW OFFICE AND 2 DAYS REMOTE\n\nAbout us\nHi, we are Ten Square Games, and we live games! No, not a typo - but a level up from loving! We are on a mission of giving players excellent outdoor experiences on their mobiles. With global hits, such as Fishing Clash, we know how to make the best of technology, fun, and fair play. With 77 million registered players in 2025 and 300+ people on board, we keep growing and learning, having the insatiable hunger for the next success. If you also like to explore the unknown and know how to own it, we want to work with you!\n\nWhat is this job all about?\nWe’re seeking a dynamic, data-driven thinker to join our product teams. Someone who combines strategy with creativity to drive product success and boost user engagement is a must. Passion for gaming - especially free-to-play - is a must. If you love playing F2P games, we want to hear from you!",
