    "desc": "Join us and be part of creating Monopoly World – an innovative mobile game that brings the classic board game to life in the real world. As a Game Designer, you will play a key role in shaping the core gameplay experience, systems, and features that make our game engaging, strategic, and globally scalable.\nThis is your opportunity to leave your creative fingerprint on a product where players explore the real world, collect venues, and build their own empires.\n\nCheck out the Monopoly World trailer:\nWe’re looking for a Game Designer to join our team on-site in our Kraków office, located in the historic building of the Old Kraków Train Station. This unique workspace fosters creativity and collaboration, perfectly aligning with the close-knit teamwork we value.\n\nTo support candidates relocating to Kraków, we’re offering a relocation package. More details about this will be shared during the recruitment process.\n\nResponsibilities\n\n• Design and balance core gameplay mechanics, systems, and progression loops.\n• Create feature specs and documentation for new game systems, events, and content.\n• Collaborate closely with developers, artists, and producers to bring your ideas to life.\n• Use data and player feedback to iterate on features and improve retention and monetization.\n• Prototype and test new gameplay ideas to validate design choices.\n• Own the end-to-end design process for specific features – from ideation to implementation.",
